msgid "Degree"
msgstr "Stupeň"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:62
msgid "Defines the direction of view left or right"
msgstr "Definuje smer pohľadu vľavo alebo vpravo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:63
msgid "Pitch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:65
msgid "Defines the direction of view up or down"
msgstr "Definuje smer pohľadu nahor alebo nadol"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:66
msgid "Roll"
msgstr "Náklon"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:68
msgid "Defines the direction of view like tilting your head left or right"
msgstr "Definuje smer pohľadu ako nakláňanie hlavy vľavo alebo vpravo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:69
msgid "FOV"
msgstr "Zorné pole"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:71
msgid ""
"The horizontal field of view, in degrees, of the resulting frame. Any value "
"over 179 results in a fisheye projection."
msgstr ""
"Horizontálne zorné pole výsledného snímku v stupňoch. Akákoľvek hodnota nad "
"179 vedie k projekcii rybieho oka."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:72
msgid "Fisheye"
msgstr "Defish"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:73
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Percentá"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/vr360_and_3d/vr360_equi2rect.rst:74
msgid ""
"The amount of fisheye to mix in. 100% means that you get a 100% fisheye lens."
msgstr ""
"Množstvo efektu rybieho oka na zmiešanie. 100 % znamená 100% objektív "
"rybieho oka."

